# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Art assets — deliberately NOT committed.
#
# The game runs on a mix of purchased packs, CC0 packs and generated art. Some
# licences forbid redistribution outright (32rogues: "You may not redistribute
# or resell it"), and a public repo is redistribution.
#
# The files stay on disk so the game runs locally; git simply never sees them.
# These rules are blanket-by-extension on purpose so art cannot be committed by
# accident, whatever directory it lands in.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tga
*.aseprite
*.ase
*.psd
*.xcf
*.afdesign

# Third-party packs in full — including their bundled licences and indexes
**/public/32rogues-0.5.0/
**/public/rpgitems-retro/
**/public/7soulsrpggraphics_iconpack/
**/public/48_Free_Minerals_Pixel_Art_Icons_Pack/
**/public/2D-Pixel-Art-Character-Template/
**/public/CharacterTemplates_DesireFantasy/
**/public/Top-Down Asset Pack (Oct 2025)/
**/public/kenney_1-bit-pack/

# Generated, VFX and environment art
**/public/art/
**/public/fx/
**/public/lighting/
**/public/tilesets/
**/public/traps/
**/public/assets/fonts/

# Escape hatch: README screenshots are permitted use (showing the game running
# is fine; shipping the source files is not).
!docs/screenshots/
!docs/screenshots/**


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build output and dependencies
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Editor / OS
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.sw?

# Scratch
.fallow/
notes.txt

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
